data srv2_lab_instance_note: String = "THE ACTUATING srv2 INSTANCE, added because the preview one could never have worked and its failure mode was silent until someone ran it. srv2_preview above is DashboardObserveOnly, so its dispatch endpoint refuses by construction — correct, and invisible on a page whose buttons simply read disabled. It also had no entry in gunbc.roadmap_dashboard_instance_apply, which contained zero srv2 references, so nothing in the tree could provision the directories its observations refuse against. Declared, servable, and unreachable in the same value.\\n\\nThis row is the actuating peer: same isolated layout, its own root and named tmux server, DashboardActuating so dispatch is admitted, DashboardLocalProvision because srv2 provisions itself rather than over SSH. It listens on 18082 — 18080 is the preview's declared port and 18081 is srv1's lab, and a port collision resolved by passing a different --port on the command line is how the last deployment ended up serving one instance's page under another instance's identity.\\n\\nThe preview row is deliberately kept rather than repointed. It is the observe-only posture's only live specimen, several witnesses discriminate against it, and deleting a row because a better one arrived is how the 2026-07-27 authority refresh lost the only execution contract it had."

data srv2_dashboard_lab_id: std.types.NonEmptyStr = "srv2-lab-v1-deletion" as std.types.NonEmptyStr

data srv2_dashboard_lab_root: std.types.FilePath = "/home/briansrls/.local/share/gunbc-dashboard-instances/srv2-lab-v1-deletion" as std.types.FilePath

fn srv2_lab_dashboard_instance() -> gunbc.roadmap_dashboard_instance.HostDashboardInstance {
